            "snippets": [
              "# Trump: US to impose 10% tariffs on $300B in Chinese goods\nTrump also alluded to the possibility the 10% duty rate could increase or decrease, depending on the outcome of negotiations. \"It can be lifted up to well beyond 25%,\" he said. \"But we’re not looking to do that necessarily.\"",
